ui.changelog:title=%s Changelog
ui.changelog.label:1=§9Welcome to %s! This update is primarily for bug fixes and operator features.
ui.changelog.label:2=- Eliminated the server/realm lag caused by this addon.
ui.changelog.label:3=- Reimplemented entity protection to be event driven making it extremely reliable, especially when hit with disallowed projectiles.
ui.changelog.label:4=- Fixed issue causing hotbar items to sometimes swap when entering a claim.
ui.changelog.label:5=- Fixed issue with teleport detection; this is done to revert a teleport if your not allowed in a claim.
ui.changelog.label:6=- Fixed hourly claim block payment timer not starting/reseting to 60
ui.changelog.label:7=- Added an op option to change how the claim shovel is distributed to players. Options: Lock to Inventory, Give at Spawn, Must be Crafted. Found in the addon config page.
ui.changelog.label:8=- New player config page in the op manage player menu.
ui.changelog.label:9=- Moved edit claim blocks to the op player config page.
ui.changelog.label:10=- Added an op option to change claim block behavior. Options: Default, Disable Payment, Unlimited. Found in the player config page.
ui.changelog.label:11=- Added Update Existing Block Balances toggle to the op addon config menu.
ui.changelog.label:12=- Fixed disallow messages sometimes being spammed.
ui.changelog.label:13=- Added in game changelogs... hi there :D
ui.changelog.button:back=<< Main Menu

ui.addon_setup:title=§5Shovel§r Land Claim - Setup (%s/%s)
ui.addon_setup.body:page_1=§5SLC§r would like to disable the "showTags" gamerule. This will hide the "This item cannot be dropped..." text thats shown when holding the Claim Shovel.\n §nYour seeing this because your a world operator.
ui.addon_setup.body:page_2=§5SLC§r would also like to disable "doFireTick" to prevent fire from spreading into claims.\n §nYour seeing this because your a world operator.
ui.addon_setup.button:disable_showTags=Disable "showTags"
ui.addon_setup.button:disable_doFireTick=Disable "doFireTick"
ui.addon_setup.button:skip=§cSkip§r

